@HelpDesk.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5269
@token = COLE_O_TOKEN_DO_LOGIN_AQUI

### Login como solicitante
POST {{HelpDesk.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "usuario@helpdesk.local",
  "password": "Usuario@123"
}

### Consultar o usuário autenticado
GET {{HelpDesk.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Criar um chamado
POST {{HelpDesk.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Impressora não funciona",
  "description": "A impressora do financeiro aparece como offline.",
  "priority": "High"
}

### Listar todos os chamados
GET {{HelpDesk.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Consultar um chamado
GET {{HelpDesk.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Filtrar por status
GET {{HelpDesk.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tickets?status=Open
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Buscar e combinar filtros
GET {{HelpDesk.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tickets?search=impressora&priority=High&status=Open
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Consultar indicadores
GET {{HelpDesk.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Atualizar um chamado
PUT {{HelpDesk.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Impressora não funciona",
  "description": "O cabo foi verificado; o equipamento continua offline.",
  "priority": "High",
  "status": "InProgress"
}

### Atribuir a um técnico
PATCH {{HelpDesk.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/1/assign
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "technicianUserId": 2
}

### Adicionar comentário
POST {{HelpDesk.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/1/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Estou verificando este chamado."
}

### Excluir um chamado
DELETE {{HelpDesk.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
